            ok: 'the disadvantages are greater for most students, so online lessons should support classes, not replace them',
            wrong: [
              ['the disadvantages is greater for most students, so online lessons should support classes, not replace them', '"The disadvantages" is plural. Check the verb after it.'],
              ['the disadvantages are greater for most students, so online lessons should supporting classes, not replace them', 'After "should" the verb has no -ing.'],
              ['the disadvantages and the advantages are both important for students', 'This is not a verdict. It does not say which side is heavier.']
            ],
